WEBVTT

00:08:19.992 --> 00:08:47.889
★Did you buy a new umbrella? I thought you loved your old one.
☆I did. But the wind was so strong yesterday that it broke. I had to throw it away.
★Oh, that’s too bad. At least you bought a nice new one.
☆I hope it doesn’t break, too. It was quite expensive.
☆☆Question: Why did the woman buy a new umbrella?
